INSERT INTO "Module" (id,"bookId",title,"order","pageCount") VALUES ('dc0e2df6-dd27-533a-91a6-ab4eb376d372','a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','Блок 19. Was / Were',19,0);
INSERT INTO "LessonUnit" (id,"moduleId",title,"orderIndex",kind,"passThreshold",intro) VALUES ('9c5a1622-f8f7-5e8a-a0a6-382befd366dd','dc0e2df6-dd27-533a-91a6-ab4eb376d372','Was / Were',0,'LESSON',70,$j$[{"type": "rule", "text": "The past simple of the verb 'to be' is was/were."}, {"type": "rule", "text": "We use 'was' with I, he, she, it. We use 'were' with we, you, they."}, {"type": "rule", "text": "Interrogative: was/were + subject. Negative: was/were + not (wasn't, weren't)."}, {"type": "text", "text": "Time expressions: yesterday, last week, two days ago, in 1997."}, {"type": "examples", "items": ["Marilyn Monroe was an actress.", "They weren't at the park yesterday."]}]$j$::jsonb);
INSERT INTO "LessonUnit" (id,"moduleId",title,subtitle,"orderIndex",kind,"passThreshold",intro) VALUES ('6646503a-06d4-5846-a755-a5a93836c931','dc0e2df6-dd27-533a-91a6-ab4eb376d372','Тест блока: Was / Were','Ответь верно минимум на 70%, чтобы открыть следующий блок',1,'TEST',70,'[]'::jsonb);
